    "title": "Solitaire",
    "description": "New style free card game Solitaire. It also known as Classic Solitaire or Patience card game.\r\nWe kept the game true to the spirit of the classic Solitaire. Funny and challenging card game that anyone can enjoy. \r\nSimple to start but hard to master. Popular with casual fans and casino lovers alike.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\u2660 Single tap or drag&drop to move cards\r\n\u2660 Customizable beautiful themes\r\n\u2660 Daily challenges\r\n\u2660 Clean and user-friendly menus \r\n\u2660 Draw 1 card, draw 3 cards \r\n\u2660 Auto complete\r\n\u2660 Auto-save game\r\n\u2660 Unlimited free UNDO moves\r\n\u2660 Unlimited free hints\r\n\u2660 Left-handed supported\r\n\u2660 Tablet supported\r\n\u2660 More features to come!\r\n\r\nHave fun with playing Solitaire!",
